# Forge

Read `docs/forge-principles.md` before product or UX changes. Business hypothesis: `docs/forge-business-hypothesis.md`. Do not alter the meaning of the原典 without owner GO.

UI copy / density / Special Thanks purpose: **`docs/forge-ui-copy-rules.md`** (also summarized in `AGENTS.md`).

- Judge features by whether they strengthen the **learning loop** (discover → play → first feedback → next fix → next version). Change-watching, replay, witness are amplifiers
- Do not change specs for implementation convenience
- Do not store shared production user data in localStorage (drafts/UI state only; Supabase for persistence)
- **User-facing UI never uses 「声」** — use 「フィードバック」; short badges may use 「FB」. Do not ship 「声を届ける」「みんなの声」「プレイヤーの声」「届けた声」. Do not rename `voice_*` DB/internal identifiers casually. Details: `docs/forge-ui-copy-rules.md`
- **User-facing UI prefers ver / バージョン over 「版」** — short UI: `ver` / `ver N` / `最新ver`; prose: `バージョン`. Avoid `最新版` / `次版` / `この版` / `N版` / `版ごとの声`. **Exception:** status labels `正式版` / `正式版候補` are allowed — do **not** rewrite to `正式ver`. Do not rename DB `version_*` casually
- **Prefer structure over prose** — before adding explanatory copy, try badges / chips / icons / tables / cards. Section blurbs: none by default (1 line max). Do not duplicate the same fact left/right or above/below. Dates / versions / counts belong in meta chips, not body sentences
- **Special Thanks** = `/games/[id]` tab showing who contributed how to **that** project (not platform `/special-thanks`, not LP/footer). Not a changelog, analytics panel, or feedback-body list. Reasons to appear = badges/meta, not paragraphs. Same player may appear in multiple sections
- **List/card UI verification** — never PASS on a single seeded row. Confirm with 10+ items, long names, avatar on/off, handle on/off, multiple versions/counts, desktop 2-col / expand / mobile
- **GPT memo abolished (2026-06 owner policy)**: do **not** update `docs/chatgpt-summary.md` or append ` ```text ` blocks on every task. Write owner-oriented content in the **main response** (what changed, verify steps, owner vs Cursor actions, risks). Owner copies manually when needed.
- **Handoff files** (`docs/forge-handoff.md`, `docs/chatgpt-handoff.md`): **do not touch on normal tasks**. Full rewrite **only** on milestones — major theme done, migration applied, roadmap priority change, or owner says 引継ぎ. See `AGENTS.md` §Documentation duty.
- Legacy thick format: `docs/chatgpt-summary-format.md` — use **only** when owner explicitly asks for GPT memo / 引継ぎ.
- When a **design decision** is involved (DB, auth, notifications, permissions, storage, extensibility): briefly note recommendation, reason, and concern in the response — not a long `■` template every time.
- On completed tasks: update `docs/forge-changelog.md` only (not handoff/summary unless milestone).
- Before **§10.2 stop conditions only** (billing, new API contracts, prod public launch, PLAYER_VISIBLE=true, destructive DB, data migration,原典 change, roadmap priority change, irreversible ops): output **GPT判断用メモ** from `docs/gpt-run-decision-memo.md`. Task flow through design→impl→build→staging→main prep runs without per-step approval. **`docs/forge-triage-operations.md` §10**.
- **通常作業（2026-07-14〜）**: 調査〜Preview smoke まで自律（investigate→edit→verify→commit→preview push→deploy→smoke）。Staging Supabase は常時自律。詳細 `docs/cursor-allow-vs-forge-go.md`
- **オーナー指示 = スコープ承認**: 指示範囲内で commit / push / Staging migration / smoke 等を再確認しない
- **「本番反映して」「リリースして」** = コード本番の一括承認（main 反映+push・Production deploy・smoke・main↔preview 同期）。工程ごとの確認はしない
- **Production Supabase**: migration / INSERT / UPDATE / DELETE / backfill / Storage 変更は **オーナー手動**。Cursor は SQL・実行順・影響・確認 SQL を提示。適用後の read-only 検証と smoke は自律
- **Run Mode**: オーナーは full-auto 寄り。Production DB write だけは手動境界を維持
- **Preview / main 同期**: 本番 push 後は `preview/landing-01` を `main` に fast-forward + push。詳細 **`docs/forge-triage-operations.md` §8**.

Full rules: `AGENTS.md`, `docs/forge-principles.md`, `docs/forge-ui-copy-rules.md`, `docs/forge-triage-operations.md`.
